        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adam Amin, Dusty Dvoracek\n- Organizations: ESPN, Chicago Bears, National Football League, Omaha Nighthawks, United Football League, Oklahoma\n- Events: 2006 NFL Draft\n- Programs: ESPN College Football Friday Primetime\n\nFacts:\n- Dusty Dvoracek played college football at Oklahoma before entering professional football.\n- In the third round of the 2006 NFL Draft, the Chicago Bears of the National Football League drafted Dusty Dvoracek.\n- Dusty Dvoracek played professionally for the Chicago Bears from 2006 to 2009.\n- Dusty Dvoracek played professionally for the Omaha Nighthawks of the United Football League from 2010 to 2011.\n- In 2017, Adam Amin and Dusty Dvoracek were the announcers for ESPN College Football Friday Primetime.",
